No. days $=365=52$ weeks +1 extra day
$\begin{aligned}
& \quad\{\mathrm{S}, \mathrm{M}, \mathrm{~T}, \mathrm{~W}, \text { Th, F, Sat }\} \\
& \mathrm{P}((53 \mathrm{~S}) \mathrm{U}(53 \text { Sat }))=\mathrm{P}(\text { Sat })+\mathrm{P}(\mathrm{~S}) \\
& =\frac{1}{7}+\frac{1}{7}=\frac{2}{7}
\end{aligned}$
